          "test": "yes -> the facility may be within the industry category covered by this subpart; no -> the facility is not in that industry category",
          "citations": [
            "40 CFR 63.11158"
          ],
          "quote": "Secondary copper smelter means a facility that processes copper scrap in a blast furnace and converter or that uses another pyrometallurgical purification process to produce anode copper from copper scrap, including low-grade copper scrap."
